        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY, THEN COMMAND!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Scum fuses deckbuilding with crunchy, grid-based tactics. The cards in your deck are your units, ship equipment and items. Each turn, you must balance your command points between playing cards onto the board and directing units and equipment already in play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/74d40bf072bdd3d72bc181433fda9e83.poster.avif?t=1777944719\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/74d40bf072bdd3d72bc181433fda9e83.webm?t=1777944719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/74d40bf072bdd3d72bc181433fda9e83.mp4?t=1777944719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOTAL DECKBUILDING FREEDOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 4 different factions with unique play styles and sets of cards, but you can mix and match cards from all of them to discover unexpected strategies and card synergies. You can take cards from your opponent's decks after defeating them in battle in the roguelike run or build custom decks from any of the cards in the game in the custom battle and multiplayer modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/4c5948a6c335aa9ad82c47166ba1675a.avif?t=1777944719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras_big/4c5948a6c335aa9ad82c47166ba1675a.avif?t=1777944719 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVIOUS OPPONENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your opponents are playing the same game as you. The enemy ships you fight against are decks procedurally generated from the same pool of cards that you have access to and they have to play by the same rules. The game's AI has been finely tuned to be a challenging and unexpected adversary at all difficulty levels. And once you've bested the most difficult AI opponents, you can take your decks online against other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANY WAYS TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from the main roguelike run, the game includes many other ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges Mode - Complete fun and difficult challenge battles to unlock rare cards for your custom decks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skirmish Mode - Design custom battles and experiment with different decks and strategies against an AI opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer - Take your custom decks to a ranked online server against other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY, THEN COMMAND!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Scum fuses deckbuilding with crunchy, grid-based tactics. The cards in your deck are your units, ship equipment and items. Each turn, you must balance your command points between playing cards onto the board and directing units and equipment already in play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/74d40bf072bdd3d72bc181433fda9e83.poster.avif?t=1777944719\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/74d40bf072bdd3d72bc181433fda9e83.webm?t=1777944719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/74d40bf072bdd3d72bc181433fda9e83.mp4?t=1777944719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOTAL DECKBUILDING FREEDOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 4 different factions with unique play styles and sets of cards, but you can mix and match cards from all of them to discover unexpected strategies and card synergies. You can take cards from your opponent's decks after defeating them in battle in the roguelike run or build custom decks from any of the cards in the game in the custom battle and multiplayer modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras/4c5948a6c335aa9ad82c47166ba1675a.avif?t=1777944719\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886700/extras_big/4c5948a6c335aa9ad82c47166ba1675a.avif?t=1777944719 width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVIOUS OPPONENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your opponents are playing the same game as you. The enemy ships you fight against are decks procedurally generated from the same pool of cards that you have access to and they have to play by the same rules. The game's AI has been finely tuned to be a challenging and unexpected adversary at all difficulty levels. And once you've bested the most difficult AI opponents, you can take your decks online against other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANY WAYS TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from the main roguelike run, the game includes many other ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges Mode - Complete fun and difficult challenge battles to unlock rare cards for your custom decks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skirmish Mode - Design custom battles and experiment with different decks and strategies against an AI opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer - Take your custom decks to a ranked online server against other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
